<title>VENEZUELA: Electricidad de Caracas plans cash div.</title>
<headline>Electricidad de Caracas plans cash div.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's private Electricidad de Caracas will pay a 3.00 bolivar per share cash dividend on June 30 to shareholders of record on June 23, the company said in a press statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It will be the second cash dividend so far this year after the company resumed its cash dividend policy with a 3.00 bolivar per share payout on April 28.</p>
<p>The previous dividend was on May 26 of last year, when the company paid one share for every 25 held.</p>
<p>((-- Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
